  "bodyHash": "8Rw5+7A1N34=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。適用於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的眾多活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>雙開門是一個簡約風格的模組，能讓相同的雙門、活板門和柵欄門同時打開。這可以透過點擊任何一扇（木製）門來達成，或透過單一的壓力板或按鈕。預設情況下，該模組也會找出其他相連的門類方塊並將其開啟，最遠可達 10 個方塊的距離。此功能可在設定檔中切換。<br><br>村民也能夠打開雙開門！<br><br>蹲下時將停用雙開門功能，僅開啟或關閉單一方塊。<br><br></span><span><strong>如果你想讓柵欄門和活板門也能「雙開」，請務必在設定檔中啟用此功能！</strong><br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum's RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的設定選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>enableRecursiveOpening</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>是否啟用遞迴開啟功能。啟用後，您可以建造一個由活板門組成的巨型門，只要這些方塊相連，它們就會同時開啟。「recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance」設定選項可決定此功能的搜尋距離。<br><br><span><strong>recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 10，最小值 1，最大值 32<br>當「enableRecursiveOpening」啟用時，遞迴功能應搜尋的方塊數量。<br><br><span><strong>enableDoors</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>啟用時，模組對雙開門生效。<br><br><span><strong>enableFenceGates</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false<br>啟用時，模組對雙開柵欄門生效。<br><br><span><strong>enableTrapdoors</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false<br>啟用時，模組對雙開活板門生效。<br><br><span><strong>enableModIncompatibilityCheck</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true<br>檢查是否有其他具有雙開門功能的模組已載入。若發現，則會在其設定檔中修改一行以停用其雙開門功能。修復因程式碼被執行兩次而導致的門無法開啟問題。<br><br></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>適用於所有雙開門配置，也能遞迴作用於其他所有方塊！</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"332\"><br><br><span><strong>任何相連的門類方塊都會被遞迴找到並開啟：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><br><span><strong>預設情況下，遞迴功能會開啟 10 格外的方塊，但這可以透過「recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance」設定來更改：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong><span><br>點擊兩扇門中的任何一扇，另一扇也會隨之開啟：</span></strong><br></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"848\" height=\"428\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><br><span><strong>用單一按鈕開啟鐵門，或任何其他配置。</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/e.webp\" alt=\"gif1\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><br><span><strong>適用於上下堆疊的活板門和柵欄門，可透過點擊或壓力板/按鈕觸發。</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/f.webp\" alt=\"gif2\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</details>\n<p><br><span><br><span><strong>村民也能夠打開雙開門！</strong></span></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/h.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模組，只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概述與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若遇到問題、有想法、建議或其他任何事項，請前往 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
